TITLE

LOCAL FILESYSTEM FOUNDATION V1


MISSION

Introduce the first concrete Device-owned filesystem in Synthesis.

The purpose of this slice is to establish one durable rule:

FILES BELONG TO THE DEVICE.

The Files application and Terminal must become two interfaces over the same
canonical local Device filesystem.

Conceptually:

LOCAL DEVICE
    │
    └── FILESYSTEM
          │
          ├── Files App
          │
          └── Terminal
                ├── ls
                └── cat

This task replaces the current presentation-only Files mock with real canonical
simulation state.

Keep the implementation deliberately small.

V1 contains exactly one initial text file:

/home/user/welcome.txt

Do not build a virtual operating-system filesystem framework.

Do not add remote filesystem gameplay yet.


